#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:385
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar appearing on top"
msgid ""
"You don't have permission to read this folder: <filename>%1</filename><nl/>"
"It cannot be included in the source selection. If it does not contain anything"
" important to you, one possible solution is to exclude the folder from the bac"
"kup plan."
msgstr ""
"Non ten permiso para ler o cartafol <filename>%1</filename>.<nl/>"
"Non pode incluírse na selección de orixes. Se non contén nada que lle importe,"
" unha posíbel solución é excluír o cartafol da planificación de salvagarda."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:396
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar appearing on top"
msgid ""
"You don't have permission to read this file: <filename>%1</filename><nl/>"
"It cannot be included in the source selection. If the file is not important to"
" you, one possible solution is to exclude the whole folder where the file is s"
"tored from the backup plan."
msgstr ""
"Non ten permiso para ler o ficheiro <filename>%1</filename>.<nl/>"
"Non pode incluírse na selección de orixes. Se o ficheiro non lle importa, unha"
" posíbel solución é excluír o cartafol enteiro que o contén da planificación d"
"a salvagarda."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:412
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar appearing on top"
msgid ""
"The symbolic link <filename>%1</filename> points to a folder which is not incl"
"uded: <filename>%2</filename>.<nl/>"
"That is probably not what you want. One solution is to simply include the targ"
"et folder in the backup plan."
msgstr ""
"A ligazón simbólica <filename>%1</filename> apunta a un cartafol que non está "
"incluído: <filename>%2</filename>.<nl/>"
"Probabelmente non sexa o que quere. Unha posíbel solución é incluír o cartafol"
" de destino na planificación de salvagarda."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:421
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar appearing on top"
msgid ""
"The symbolic link <filename>%1</filename> points to a file which is not includ"
"ed: <filename>%2</filename>.<nl/>"
"That is probably not what you want. One solution is to simply include the fold"
"er where the file is stored in the backup plan."
msgstr ""
"A ligazón simbólica <filename>%1</filename> apunta a un ficheiro que non está "
"incluído: <filename>%2</filename>.<nl/>"
"Probabelmente non sexa o que quere. Unha posíbel solución é incluír o cartafol"
" no que se almacena o ficheiro na planificación de salvagarda."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:447
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Select Folder"
msgstr "Seleccionar o cartafol"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:483
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "Descrición:"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:485
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Back to overview"
msgstr "Volver á vista xeral"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:523
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Back up multiple versions over time of the files in the source folders. This a"
"llows older versions of files or deleted files to be recovered.<nl/>"
"</nl/>"
"The backup archive will grow in size over time, and can only be accessed using"
" the recovery tools provided by this program."
msgstr ""
"Salvagardar varias versións ao longo do tempo dos ficheiros dos cartafoles de "
"orixe. Isto permite recuperar versións anteriores de ficheiros ou ficheiros el"
"iminados.<nl/>"
"</nl/>"
"O arquivo de salvagarda medrará co tempo, e só pode accederse a el mediante as"
" ferramentas de recuperación deste programa."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:535
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid ""
"Versioned Backup (not available because <application>bup</application> is not "
"installed)"
msgstr ""
"Salvagarda versionada (non dispoñíbel porque <application>bup</application> no"
"n está instalado)"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:540
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Versioned Backup (recommended)"
msgstr "Salvagarda versionada (recoméndase)"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:545
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Make the destination folder identical to the source folder. Files deleted from"
" a source folder will be deleted from the backup folder as well.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"This can prevent data loss due to a broken disk, but not due to files being ac"
"cidentally deleted or changed."
msgstr ""
"Facer o cartafol de destino idéntico ao de orixe. Os ficheiros eliminados do d"
"e orixe eliminaranse tamén do de salvagarda.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"Isto pode evitar a perda de datos por rotura de disco, pero non pola eliminaci"
"ón ou cambio accidental de ficheiros."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:557
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid ""
"Synchronized Backup (not available because <application>rsync</application> is"
" not installed)"
msgstr ""
"Salvagarda sincronizada (non dispoñíbel porque <application>rsync</application"
"> non está instalado)"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:562
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Synchronized Backup"
msgstr "Salvagarda sincronizada"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:590
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Backup Type"
msgstr "Tipo de salvagarda"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:591
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Select what type of backup you want"
msgstr "Seleccione o tipo de salvagarda que quere."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:600
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Sources"
msgstr "Fontes"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:601
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Select which folders to include in backup"
msgstr "Seleccione os cartafoles para incluír na salvagarda."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:616
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Filesystem Path"
msgstr "Ruta do sistema de ficheiros"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:617
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "External Storage"
msgstr "Almacenamento externo"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:623
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"You can use this option for backing up to a secondary internal harddrive, an e"
"xternal eSATA drive or networked storage. The requirement is just that you alw"
"ays mount it at the same path in the filesystem. The path specified here does "
"not need to exist at all times, its existence will be monitored."
msgstr ""
"Pode usar esta opción para salvagardar nun disco duro interno secundario, nun "
"disco eSATA externo, ou en almacenamento de rede. O único requisito é montalo "
"sempre na mesma ruta do sistema de ficheiros. A ruta indicada aquí non ten por"
" que existir en todo momento, monitorizarase a súa existencia."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:630
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Destination Path for Backup:"
msgstr "Ruta de destino da salvagarda:"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:641
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar near text edit"
msgid "Only local filesystem paths will work!"
msgstr "Só funcionarán as rutas do sistema de ficheiros local."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:648
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar near text edit"
msgid "Folder does not exist! No backups will be saved until you create it."
msgstr "O cartafol non existe. Non se farán salvagardas ata que o cree."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:667
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Use this option if you want to backup your files on an external storage that c"
"an be plugged in to this computer, such as a USB hard drive or memory stick."
msgstr ""
"Use esta opción se quere salvagardar os ficheiros nun almacenamento externo qu"
"e pode conectarse ao computador, como un disco duro externo ou un pincho USB."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:676 kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:679
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "The specified folder will be created if it does not exist."
msgstr "O cartafol indicado crearase se non existe."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:678
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Folder on Destination Drive:"
msgstr "Cartafol do disco de destino:"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:685
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Open dialog to select a folder"
msgstr "Abrir un diálogo para seleccionar un cartafol."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:715
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Destino"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:716
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Select the backup destination"
msgstr "Seleccionar o destino da salvagarda"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:734
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Manual Activation"
msgstr "Activación manual"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:735
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Interval"
msgstr "Intervalo"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:736
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Active Usage Time"
msgstr "Tempo de uso activo"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:739
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Backups are only saved when manually requested. This can be done by using the "
"Backup Status plasma widget."
msgstr ""
"As salvagardas fanse só cando se solicita manualmente. Pode solicitarse median"
"te o trebello de Plasma de estado de salvagarda."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:754
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"New backup will be triggered when backup destination becomes available and mor"
"e than the configured interval has passed since the last backup was saved."
msgstr ""
"Iniciarase unha nova salvagarda canto o seu destino pase a estar dispoñíbel e "
"se superase o intervalo configurado desde a última salvagarda."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:771
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Minutes"
msgstr "Minutos"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:772 kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:799
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Hours"
msgstr "Horas"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:773
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Días"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:774
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Weeks"
msgstr "Semanas"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:784
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"New backup will be triggered when backup destination becomes available and you"
" have been using your computer actively for more than the configured time limi"
"t since the last backup was saved."
msgstr ""
"Iniciarase unha nova salvagarda canto o seu destino pase a estar dispoñíbel e "
"leve usando activamente o computador un tempo superior ao límite configurado d"
"esde a última salvagarda."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:804
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Ask for confirmation before saving backup"
msgstr "Pedir confirmación antes de salvagardar."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:823
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Schedule"
msgstr "Planificar"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:824
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Specify the backup schedule"
msgstr "Indique unha planificación de salvagarda."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:838
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Show hidden folders in source selection"
msgstr "Amosar os cartafoles agochados na selección de orixes."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:842
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This makes it possible to explicitly include or exclude hidden folders in the "
"backup source selection. Hidden folders have a name that starts with a dot. Th"
"ey are typically located in your home folder and are used to store settings an"
"d temporary files for your applications."
msgstr ""
"Isto permite incluír ou excluír explicitamente cartafoles agochados na selecci"
"ón de orixes de salvagarda. Os cartafoles agochados teñen un nome que comeza c"
"un punto («.»). Adoitan estar no cartafol persoal e úsanos as aplicacións para"
" almacenar configuracións e ficheiros temporais."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:863
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This will make your backups use around 10% more storage space and saving backu"
"ps will take slightly longer time. In return it will be possible to recover fr"
"om a partially corrupted backup."
msgstr ""
"Isto aumentará o tamaño das salvagardas aproximadamente un 10%, e salvagardar "
"tardará un pouco máis. A cambio, poderá recuperar datos dunha salvagarda parci"
"almente corrompida."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:869
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Generate recovery information"
msgstr "Xerar información de recuperación."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:872
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid ""
"Generate recovery information (not available because <application>par2</applic"
"ation> is not installed)"
msgstr ""
"Xerar información de recuperación (non está dispoñíbel porque <application>par"
"2</application> non está instalado)."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:888
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Verify integrity of backups"
msgstr "Verificar a integridade das salvagardas."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:892
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Checks the whole backup archive for corruption every time you save new data. S"
"aving backups will take a little bit longer time but it allows you to catch co"
"rruption problems sooner than at the time you need to use a backup, at that ti"
"me it could be too late."
msgstr ""
"Comproba se o arquivo de salvagarda enteiro está corrupto cada vez que garda d"
"atos novos. Salvagardar tardará un pouco máis pero permítelle detectar problem"
"as de corrupción de maneira anticipada, e non no momento de intentar usar a sa"
"lvagarda, que quizais sexa tarde de máis."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:908
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Exclude files and folders based on patterns"
msgstr "Excluír ficheiros e cartafoles que cumpran certos padróns."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:926
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Patterns need to be listed in a text file with one pattern per line. Files and"
" folders with names that match any of the patterns will be excluded from the b"
"ackup. The pattern format is documented <link url='%1'>here</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ten que listar os padróns nun ficheiro de texto, cun padrón por liña. Os fiche"
"iros e cartafoles con nomes que coincidan con algún dos padróns excluiranse da"
" salvagarda. A documentación do formato dos padróns está <link url='%1'>aquí</"
"link>."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:944
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Open dialog to select a file"
msgstr "Abrir un diálogo para seleccionar un ficheiro."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:946
#, kde-format
msgid "Select pattern file"
msgstr "Seleccionar un ficheiro de padróns"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:971
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanzado"

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:972
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Extra options for advanced users"
msgstr "Opcións adicionais para uso avanzado."

#. +> trunk5
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1002
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Create Folder"
msgstr "Crear un cartafol"

